<title>POLAND: ROLIMPEX NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 0.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>ROLIMPEX NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 0.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.66 vs   3.39</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.72 vs   5.67</p>
